{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_04_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3b8fdecd154f8f522be0741d62df2c440ede4b437ed761f20d5224ba590f156d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720d326a0cceaae8227d355f40764fc98a45069a6ccfceae89241fed58be343c",
      "text": "掷出的315点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74e6b3dc69ae2df94883e52afd6182bc43b28109f1b7d2230869ef3e38cb47e",
      "text": "虽然来到了315 Pro，但类和次郎却得知试镜的\n举办时间其实还在后头。\n然而凭借类的talking skills，\n情况却朝着意想不到的方向发展……？另一边道夫，\n收到了来自父亲的一份寄语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720d326a0cceaae8227d355f40764fc98a45069a6ccfceae89241fed58be343c",
      "text": "掷出的315点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eea9209ae61a248f2bd6f46aea08ac935ef602ada12aa5aaf51c50ec487fb6a",
      "text": "事务所·会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07ecc8c34ed9f985d8bf745105c3e8d5495ebd473930716b3e126c8ffa1b1033",
      "text": "呼，原来如此……虽然是不请自来，\n承蒙您告诉了我们很多关于偶像的事情，真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75607cc5ab1ccedff3dedcb164fe9ff5d40df9563d4744b9c6fca4d37ff62e0a",
      "text": "（正如预料的那样，看起来是家刚成立的事务所，\n但氛围相当不错……不过，根据刚才的说法）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae424a05bfd0f9f7537080aaa8ab054be00df8eefa1cdde68f05fe124a51b98e",
      "text": "（今天的试镜刚刚结束。\n下一次举办，还得过一阵子……吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c1367e99693ed3a5abcfb4db2323a8f8d04ba4b0c7b1a43f8de5852d4e1e2eb",
      "text": "……那个，我可以提个question吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38900d90a3e42d2ddfc4f984cd30a2ba7dc157768ec4a0351f0c671f70cccb44",
      "text": "参加试镜的人，\n果然还是比我们年轻的孩子占多数吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb56e5942362dac70a22faa3b2f45ed98492d3997c5ac5e7f6535aa33593e421",
      "text": "嗯——是呢。\n从整体比例来看，感觉确实是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c84920c85bd266ebffe4d3871e120e71326aaa2c0b68e3db9c8c6d2a00e50f",
      "text": "年轻孩子光鲜亮丽固然很棒☆ ……But，\n有时候光有那个也会不够的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ccfd5c61cb76af7b787aa4eb56df38c4e0aa109585fc1d44365ef6e19efced",
      "text": "……您的意思是？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
